  "body": "Welcome to 57 Pacific Heights Road, Orewa, where luxurious and comfortable living awaits your family. This exquisite home, built on a generous site of approximately 759 square meters with a total floor area of around 246 square meters, offers an unparalleled living experience.\r\n\r\nThe home features a fantastic layout that maximizes the terrain, with 5 spacious bedrooms and 4 bathrooms (2 ensuites) providing a serene retreat for every family member. The open-plan living room on the top floor boasts an expansive balcony, perfect for BBQs and gatherings with family and friends. This space blends style and functionality, ideal for both entertaining guests and enjoying quiet family moments.\r\n\r\nAmple living space is ensured with a master suite, an additional bedroom, and two bathrooms (1 ensuite), catering to everyone's comfort. The thoughtful design includes two kitchens and a storage room on the top floor, meeting the needs of a large family and providing plenty of space for culinary adventures and storage.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor boasts a master bedroom and two secondary bedrooms, thoughtfully designed to provide ample space for relaxation. A shared bathroom serves the secondary bedrooms, ensuring convenience and privacy. The double garage, seamlessly integrated with the laundry room, offers an innovative design that effectively isolates the humid space, maximizing the indoor living area. This layout not only enhances functionality but also creates a more spacious and comfortable environment.\r\n\r\nLocated in the desirable Pacific Heights of Orewa, this home offers a relaxed coastal lifestyle with access to fabulous beaches, cafes, restaurants, and shopping centers. The area also provides an excellent choice of schools, making it ideal for families.\r\n\r\nContact our agent, who will be onsite within 10 minutes, to explore a private viewing of this stunning property. Don't wait; call now to discover the home your family has been searching for!",
